{"final":{"answer":"The net change in the balance of unrecognized tax benefits from the end of fiscal 2007 (December 29, 2007) to the end of fiscal 2008 (December 27, 2008) is an increase of $87.8 million.","value":87.8,"unit":"USD_million","sources":["source:t8c1n0","source:t8c2n0"],"result_id":"tool:1","message":"Ending balance of unrecognized tax benefits: $214.4 million at December 27, 2008 minus $126.6 million at December 29, 2007 = $87.8 million increase (214.4 − 126.6 = 87.8)."}}